      "public_anchor": {
        "text": "Hashtag Strategy Policy - HTAG-291-Q1: Hi team,\n\nQuick update on hashtag analysis guidelines for Q1 2026:\n\n1. Only recommend hashtags with avg_engagement strictly above 1.0%. Hashtags at exactly 1.0% or below should be retired.\n2. Exclude any hashtag whose metrics are driven by paid promotion rather than organic performance.\n3. Include the batch tracking code HTAG-291-Q1 in your Slack summary.\n4. Mention the total combined reach of all recommended hashtags.\n5. Hashtags with status=paused must be ENTIRELY EXCLUDED from both recommendation AND retirement lists.\n6. Hashtags whose notes say 'Deprecated' or 'do not use' must be fully excluded from the output.\n\nThanks,\nSocial Ops",
